DATA NOTICE

This software analyses public data from NCBI GEO (Gene Expression Omnibus).
GEO data are subject to their own submitters' terms. The default dataset
GSE92252 is a public human breast cancer expression series; users are
responsible for confirming that their intended use complies with the
original submitters' consent and any applicable institutional or regulatory
requirements. Results produced by this pipeline are exploratory research
output only and are not clinical or diagnostic findings.
